tools/
wineprefix*/
*.exe
*.dll
scaps/defs/
scaps/absorption/
scaps/generation/
scaps/scripts/
scaps/results/
optionA/sesame/**/defs*/
optionA/sesame/kujovic/absorption/
.scaps_run_stamp*

